<contentList>
	<content contentuid="hbe9d9a3bg109ag4289g8e58gad52bd6b65f6" version="1">夸塞魔，葬火孽裔</content>
	<content contentuid="he00eb74bg7040g4ce9gb748g76e6e2e5b708" version="1">观察者眼魔，葬火孽裔</content>
	<content contentuid="hb3c0a31fg21afg4080g8a72gaa09416cf63d" version="1">攫取</content>
	<content contentuid="h2b5f6531g50f6g4a22ga4f6gbd67944a6052" version="1">将魔法从目标手中夺走。目标失去&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Concentration"&gt;专注&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="HASTE"&gt;加速&lt;/LSTag&gt;和&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLESS"&gt;祝福&lt;/LSTag&gt;。&lt;LSTag Tooltip="AttackRolls"&gt;攻击检定&lt;/LSTag&gt;与&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免检定&lt;/LSTag&gt;都拦不住这个小贼！</content>
	<content contentuid="ha195493ag17a2g4b25g984bgc696d7334a1e" version="1">掠夺所得</content>
	<content contentuid="h19af596cgf051g47ffga234g778a8a389c96" version="1">带着夺来的东西离开。&lt;LSTag Tooltip="MovementSpeed"&gt;移动速度&lt;/LSTag&gt;提高&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;，&lt;LSTag Tooltip="AttackRolls"&gt;攻击检定&lt;/LSTag&gt;获得&lt;b&gt;+[2]&lt;/b&gt;加值。</content>
	<content contentuid="h74f7a749gfd1cg4c4bgbbe4g9d4a6ba98a76" version="1">不稳定的存在</content>
	<content contentuid="haed43f92ge7a9g4cacgaee8gc59dec296afc" version="1">这只位面生物无法长时间停留在物质位面，当此状态结束时便会消失。</content>
	<content contentuid="ha79e2688g0ee7g41d6ga492g77e469f1af3c" version="1">噬尸妖，葬火孽裔</content>
	<content contentuid="h16a35cd2g4bc2g427cgb483g1e9d416bca80" version="1">葬火：过早召唤</content>
	<content contentuid="h8dc3d65eg0dc6g416ag8dbfg4577495b8fb6" version="1">葬火在队伍足够强大之前便召来了这头生物，穿越让它变得虚弱。</content>
</contentList>
